  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Member Profile</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n                                <li>Profile</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Volunteer Details Section Start -->\n                <section class=\"team-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n                                <div class=\"team-desc\">\n                                    <h1>Abu Maurice Bangura</h1>\n                                    <p>Abu Maurice Bangura is a seasoned Public Relations Officer (PRO) at Earth Regenerative Project Sierra Leone (EarP-SL) with a strong educational foundation in Mass Communication and a diverse background in education, communication, and community leadership. With a Bachelor of Arts (BA) Honors in Mass Communication and a Diploma in Arabic and Islamic Education, he has cultivated a unique skill set that combines effective communication strategies with a deep understanding of cultural and religious sensitivities.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Education</strong></h5>\n                                    \n                                        <strong>Bachelor of Arts (BA) Honors in Mass Communication</strong>\n                                           <p> Bachelor of Arts (BA) Honors in Mass Communication (2009 - 2013): Abu Maurice Bangura's academic journey began with the pursuit of a BA Honors in Mass Communication, providing him with a comprehensive knowledge of media, public relations, and effective communication strategies. This degree laid the foundation for his future career in communication and public relations.</p>\n                                        <strong>Diploma in Arabic and Islamic Education</strong>\n                                           <p> Diploma in Arabic and Islamic Education: In addition to his Mass Communication degree, Abu Maurice has furthered his education by obtaining a Diploma in Arabic and Islamic Education, demonstrating his commitment to intercultural understanding and bridging communication gaps across diverse communities.</p>\n                                   \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <p>Abu Maurice Bangura is a dynamic Public Relations Officer who possesses a unique blend of education, communication, and community leadership skills. His commitment to effective communication, cultural sensitivity, and ethical values makes him an asset in any role that requires fostering understanding and building positive relationships with diverse communities.</p>\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"row progess-bar-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"85\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">89%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Team Work</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"70\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">70%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Communication</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"90\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                            <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">90%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Successful Project</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"75\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">82%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Events Participation</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-4 order-lg-2 order-1\">\n                                <div class=\"sidebar style2\">\n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget style2\">\n                                        <div class=\"profile-widget\">\n                                            <img src=\"/assets/img/team/team-6.jpg\" alt=\"Image\">\n                                            <button id=\"downloadResumeButton\" class=\"btn style1\">Download Resume</button>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget\">\n                                        <div class=\"project-info-item-wrap\">\n                                            <div class=\"project-info-item\">\n                                                <h6>Name:</h6>\n                                               <sp